			"notes": "Fix some animation problem.\n修复部分动画效果的问题。\nCompatible with Create schematics and vanilla Minecraft structure.\n兼容了机械动力的蓝图和原版的结构。\nYou can now hold a Book and Quill in your off-hand to generate a materials list.\n现在可以副手持书与笔来创建物品清单。\n\nUsage:\n\nPlace the blueprint/structure file (.nbt) into the swstructure folder inside your game version directory.\n\n_Note:\nFor modded items, there may be rendering issues, missing items, or incorrect material counts. If you encounter any problems, please report them to me._\n\n使用方法：\n\n将蓝图/结构文件(.nbt)放入版本文件夹中的swstructure。\n\n_注意：_\n_对于模组物品可能会出现渲染错误、部分物品丢失或消耗物品数量错误的问题，如果发现问题可以给我反馈。_"
		},
